---
// src/pages/index.astro — Coming Soon landing page for ExchangeMeet
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<title>ExchangeMeet — Buy, Sell, and Swap Locally</title>
		<meta name="description" content="A refreshingly simple marketplace. List what you have, find what you need, meet your neighbors. No algorithms, no junk." />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<main>
			<header>
				<img src="/logo.png" alt="ExchangeMeet logo" width="72" height="72" />
				<h1>ExchangeMeet</h1>
			</header>

			<section class="hero">
				<h2>Buy. Sell. Swap. Meet your neighbors.</h2>
				<p class="tagline">
					A refreshingly simple marketplace — list what you have,
					find what you need, and trade with real people nearby.
					No algorithm deciding what you see. No junk listings.
					Just good old-fashioned exchanging, made easy.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section class="features">
				<div class="feature">
					<h4>🤝 Neighbor-to-neighbor</h4>
					<p>Trade with people in your community, not anonymous strangers across the country.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="feature">
					<h4>🔍 No algorithm games</h4>
					<p>Listings sorted by relevance and recency — what you see is what's actually there.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="feature">
					<h4>💰 Swap, don't just sell</h4>
					<p>Offer trades, cash, or both. One person's attic treasure is another's next project.</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<footer>
				<p>© 2026 ExchangeMeet · <a href="mailto:hello@exchangemeet.com">hello@exchangemeet.com</a></p>
			</footer>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	:root {
		--purple: #6d4aff;
		--dark: #1a1a2e;
		--light: #f7f7fb;
		--gray: #666;
	}

	body {
		font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
		margin: 0;
		background: var(--light);
		color: var(--dark);
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	main {
		max-width: 720px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	header h1 {
		font-size: 2.25rem;
		margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
	}

	.hero h2 {
		font-size: 1.75rem;
		margin-top: 3rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	.tagline {
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		color: var(--gray);
		max-width: 540px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.signup {
		background: #fff;
		border: 1px solid #e5e5ef;
		border-radius: 16px;
		padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
		margin: 3rem 0;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(109, 74, 255, 0.06);
	}

	.signup h3 {
		margin-top: 0;
		font-size: 1.5rem;
	}

	form {
		display: flex;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		max-width: 480px;
		margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
	}

	input[type='email'] {
		flex: 1;
		padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
		border: 1px solid #ccc;
		border-radius: 10px;
		font-size: 1rem;
		min-width: 0;
	}

	input[type='email']:focus {
		outline: 2px solid var(--purple);
		border-color: transparent;
	}

	button {
		background: var(--purple);
		color: #fff;
		border: none;
		border-radius: 10px;
		padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		cursor: pointer;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	button:hover {
		filter: brightness(1.1);
	}

	.fine-print {
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: var(--gray);
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.features {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.5rem;
		text-align: left;
		margin: 3rem 0;
	}

	.feature {
		background: #fff;
		border-radius: 12px;
		padding: 1.25rem;
		border: 1px solid #e5e5ef;
	}

	.feature h4 {
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
	}

	.feature p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.925rem;
		color: var(--gray);
	}

	footer {
		margin-top: 3rem;
		color: var(--gray);
		font-size: 0.875rem;
	}

	footer a {
		color: var(--purple);
	}

	@media (max-width: 480px) {
		form {
			flex-direction: column;
		}
	}
</style>
